"""Q4: fluctuating-price variants of Q2 and Q3.

Repository entry point::

    python Code/问题四/q4_run_model.py

The implementation reuses the verified Q3 physical/MILP core instead of keeping a
second frozen copy.  All internal energy variables are kWh.  Attachment 4 prices
are used for actual settlement; the default ``causal`` information contract uses
only prices observed before the decision time to forecast future prices.

This is a causal rolling-policy backtest, not a proof of a multistage stochastic
optimum.  Use ``--price-information known_day_ahead`` only as an explicitly
labelled alternative interpretation of Q4.
"""
